{"content":[{"c":["ACHSHAPH*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Canaanite royal city in Joshua’s time. Its king joined an alliance led by Jabin, king of Hazor, against Israel in a battle at the springs of Merom (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.11.1","r":"Josh.11.1","rawR":"Josh.11.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.11.1","value":"Josh.11.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 11:1"},"). After Israel’s decisive victory, Achshaph’s king was one of 31 Canaanite kings conquered by Joshua (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.12.20","r":"Josh.12.20","rawR":"Josh.12.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.12.20","value":"Josh.12.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 12:20"},"), fulfilling God’s promise to deliver kings into Israel’s hand (",{"href":"?bref=Deut.7.24","r":"Deut.7.24","rawR":"Deut.7.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.7.24","value":"Deut.7.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 7:24"},"). The city was subsequently assigned to Asher’s tribe for an inheritance (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.19.25","r":"Josh.19.25","rawR":"Josh.19.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.19.25","value":"Josh.19.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 19:25"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Achshaph","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 11:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.11.1","rawQueryValue":"Josh.11.1","sourceRefExact":"Josh.11.1"},{"anchorText":"Jos 12:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.12.20","rawQueryValue":"Josh.12.20","sourceRefExact":"Josh.12.20"},{"anchorText":"Dt 7:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.7.24","rawQueryValue":"Deut.7.24","sourceRefExact":"Deut.7.24"},{"anchorText":"Jos 19:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.19.25","rawQueryValue":"Josh.19.25","sourceRefExact":"Josh.19.25"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"bdaf1db125ffe0f2a8bf93e6acb55c4f3e9e64f1b62a6e105749fdcbb530bb2f","sourceItemName":"Achshaph","sourceItemOrder":85,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Achshaph","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Achshaph*","title":"Achshaph*","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}